<title>USA: Introgen IPO postponed - PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Introgen IPO postponed - PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Introgen Therapeutics Inc has indefinitely postponed its initial public stock offering because of general market conditions for biotechnology IPOs, PaineWebber Inc, the lead underwriter for the deal, said Monday.</p>
</text>
